Louxu
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 15 DEAL ZIXIH
ZIXIH 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZIXIH 3 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZIXIH 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZIXIH 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE ZIXIH ZIXIH
OR
    SRC Suit {HEARTS}
    SRC Suit {DIAMONDS}
MOVE_STACK ZIXIH ZIXIH
DEST Size > 4
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Empty
$win
OR
    PILE ALL ZIXIH Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL ZIXIH Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
